WEBVTT

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.206
kar pomeni, da se stalno tresem.

00:00:31.206 --> 00:00:34.053
Poglejte.

00:00:34.053 --> 00:00:37.460
Hudo utrujajoče je.
Sem kot Shakira, Shakira

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:39.240
in Muhammad Ali obenem.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.236
(Smeh)

00:00:42.236 --> 00:00:44.231
Cerebralna paraliza ni genetsko pogojena.

00:00:44.231 --> 00:00:47.015
Ni okvara ob rojstvu. Ni nalezljiva.

00:00:47.015 --> 00:00:50.435
Nihče ni uročil mamine maternice

00:00:50.435 --> 00:00:53.671
in nisem je dobila zato,
ker bi bila starša bratranec in sestrična,

00:00:53.671 --> 00:00:55.172
kar v resnici sta.

00:00:55.172 --> 00:00:59.241
(Smeh)

00:00:59.241 --> 00:01:01.595
Povzročijo jo samo nesreče,